OL,3,GNEWSATravel views sought on busy
OL,4,Asection of city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living and working in a busy
OL,7,Fpart of Leeds city centre are being
OL,8,Furged to share their thoughts to help
OL,9,Fimprove transport options and public
OL,10,Fspaces.
OL,12,FThe area earmarked for improvements is
OL,13,Fto the east of the city centre and
OL,14,Fincludes Leeds Bus Station, Leeds
OL,15,FPlayhouse, Leeds City College, SOYO and
OL,16,FQuarry House.
OL,18,FLeeds City Council said the section of
OL,19,Fthe city was home to "important
OL,20,Fleisure, cultural and educational
OL,21,Ffacilities", however the lack of green
OL,22,Fareas made it "uninviting".
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
