OL,3,GNEWSATravel views sought on busy
OL,4,Asection of city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Tom Hinchcliffe, from the
OL,7,Fcouncil, said: "By sharing your
OL,8,Fexperience of travelling in the area,
OL,9,Fwe'll be able to make the right
OL,10,Fimprovements to make it a safer, more
OL,11,Fwelcoming space for everyone."
